   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital inclusion to end poverty</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Established in 2005, our flagship program provides vocational training in the digital sector to underprivileged youth.  We presently operate in Cambodia, Philippines, and Vietnam and most recently in Madagascar.  Passerelles numeriques (PN) offers a IT training program at our center, for the most vulnerable and marginalized youth. Our mission is to truly develop our students&apos; employability which will allow them and their families to escape poverty in a sustainable way.</narrative>
  </description>
